-- Module sheaf charts, direct images, local equivalences and basic scalar maps.
-- Openings are the displayed type carriers and map/component definitions.
-- Chart inverses use existing composition maps, not their proofs.
-- Equal localisation elements transport the whole comparison by identity elimination.
